[{"key":"SCENARIO_s02_01150000_04_0001","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s02_01150000_04_0010","text":"──啊……\nProducer先生……"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s02_01150000_04_0020","text":"你看那边的蛋糕……！\n好厉害……！看起来好好吃……！"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s02_01150000_04_0030","text":"…………\n那个……"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s02_01150000_04_0040","text":"要不要顺路去店里？\n可以买蛋糕哦"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s02_01150000_04_0041","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s02_01150000_04_0050","text":"……！\n嘿嘿……太好了……！"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s02_01150000_04_0060","text":"那、那么……\n甜花的份，还有小夏的份，还有千雪小姐的份──"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s02_01150000_04_0070","text":"…………"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s02_01150000_04_0080","text":"甜花……？"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s02_01150000_04_0090","text":"──还、还是算了……！\n下次……再说……！"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s02_01150000_04_0100","text":"诶……！"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s02_01150000_04_0110","text":"怎么了，甜花……？\n不用客气啊……"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s02_01150000_04_0120","text":"啊……\n不是在客气……"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s02_01150000_04_0121","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s02_01150000_04_0130","text":"只是……\n下次……庙会的工作结束之后……"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s02_01150000_04_0140","text":"大家一起吃，不是更好吗……\n就当是“辛苦了”的犒劳……！"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s02_01150000_04_0150","text":"……哈哈\n嗯，说得也是。那就这样吧"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s02_01150000_04_0160","text":"嘿嘿……\n嗯……！好期待……！"}]
